f metrics is /metrics, but a request with a different path was routed to MetricsRequestHandler\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe `/metrics` endpoint is provided under the provided context-root (in this case /myroot/metrics)\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nsee description above\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1.  Create a simple quarkus application using `quarkus-resteasy` and `quarkus-smallrye-metrics`\r\n2.  in `application.properties` set the context path to a non-default value E.g. `quarkus.servlet.context-path=/myroot`\r\n3. start the application and navigate to `http://localhost:8080/myroot/metrics`\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: windows 10\r\n - Output of `java -version`: \r\n    ```\r\n    openjdk version \"11.0.2\" 2019-01-15\r\n    OpenJDK Runtime Environment 18.9 (build 11.0.2+9)\r\n    OpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM 18.9 (build 11.0.2+9, mixed mode)\r\n    ````\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): n/a (not running native)\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev:  0.21.1\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"FroMage","id":179265,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTI2NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179265?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage","html_url":"https://github.com/FroMage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FroMage/received_events","type":"User","